{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14328","headline":"少妇词 · 窦巩","name":"少妇词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"坐惜年光变，辽阳信未通。\n燕迷新画屋，春识旧花丛。\n梦绕天山外，愁翻锦字中。\n昨来谁是伴，鹦鹉在帘栊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦巩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14328.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14328","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}